      en: ["Velbert was first mentioned in a document in the year 875 AD.", "The Mariendom in Neviges was consecrated in 1968.", "The city houses Germany's only museum for locking and security technology.", "The Niederbergbahn panoramic cycle path was built on a decommissioned railway line.", "Velbert is divided into three districts: Velbert-Mitte, Neviges, and Langenberg.", "The city currently has a population of approximately 82,000 people."],
